  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this contract is to provide technical assistance to the Government of Mozambique for the implementation of EPA and WTO TFA trade facilitation reforms and capacity building to build knowledge and capacity of business associations, private sector, non-state actor(NSA) and trade and  investment promotion agencies.</narrative>
